msgstr "**Meta Quest**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md
#: 6d6694bba9234eab92f2039078fa20ac
msgid "Good consumer availability"
msgstr "消费级产品更容易买到"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:13
#: d74b5763898e43e4a4043fcfc9982f84
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:16
#: 9617aed714a4464dbdacd6a2e29c1c81
msgid ""
"Treat **Pico Enterprise** and **Pico consumer** as different SKUs. Each "
"edition has its own headset App."
msgstr "将 **Pico 企业版** 和 **Pico 消费版** 视为不同 SKU。不要把同一个头显 App 写成同时覆盖两者。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:18
#: dfcc889deccc4245afeff6c1e283a8b7
msgid ""
"**USB shared networking (USB 网络共享)** — Pico Enterprise shares a network "
"with the ROS 2 PC over USB. Consumer Pico uses the Wi-Fi path."
msgstr "**USB 网络共享** — Pico 企业版通过 USB 与 ROS 2 主机共享网络。消费版 Pico 走 Wi-Fi。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:19
#: ec02cda3f96a4a2db2ae06d2df3f7185
msgid ""
"**Different Apps** — Enterprise and consumer Pico each have their own "
"headset App. Install the App that matches the headset edition. fa-py-"
"libraries documents XRoboToolkit as “XRoboToolkit App + PC Service”, and "
"WebXR as the browser path."
msgstr "**不同的 App** — 企业版和消费版 Pico 各自有头显 App。安装与头显版本对应的 App。fa-py-libraries 把 XRoboToolkit 写成「XRoboToolkit App + PC Service」，把 WebXR 写成浏览器路径。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:21
#: 114e4d016c1f4323b4d121212625e928
msgid ""
"Store listings, extra package names, and ADB steps are in the headset / "
"fa-py-libraries READMEs when they document them."
msgstr "商店链接、额外包名和 ADB 步骤以头显 / fa-py-libraries README 写明的为准。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 040053bd604d4e7a921d030103d9317f
msgid "Pico Recommended"
msgstr "推荐 Pico"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:27
#: b00aad1311de4173a1130f87a89cedd4
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise** is the preferred Pico SKU for VR teleop (USB 网络共享, "
"matching Enterprise App, lower-latency tracking / 更跟手). Consumer Pico and"
" Meta Quest use the same WebXR and XRoboToolkit choices in the `./run.sh`"
" menu."
msgstr ""
"**Pico 企业版**是 VR 遥操作首选的 Pico 型号（USB 网络共享、匹配的企业版 App、更低延迟追踪 / 更跟手）。消费版 Pico 和 "
"Meta Quest 在 `./run.sh` 菜单里选同一组 WebXR 和 XRoboToolkit。"

