#: 922016210beb47adaa675bb7f1974444
msgid "fa-py-libraries installed"
msgstr "已安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:35
#: 1a2b7f88a25b4a1185d5d9c08d5f4856
msgid ""
"Network between the headset and the ROS 2 machine (Wi-Fi, or **USB 网络共享**"
" on Pico Enterprise)"
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机之间的网络（Wi-Fi，或 Pico 企业版上的 **USB 网络共享**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:36
#: ca7bb2a1e6c846b0bdf16b130b05bbd8
msgid ""
"**`enable_vr: true`** in the robot description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off)"
msgstr ""
"在机器人描述的 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中设置 **`enable_vr: "
"true`**（多数机型默认关闭）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:38
#: 34474333e3e64951b8b8b2caa38b6e91
msgid ""
"Before the controller will consume VR targets, set `enable_vr: true` in "
"that YAML. Related fields on the same file: `vr_update_rate` (used when "
"VR is on) and `vr_follow_frame` (full-body follow frame; see "
"[Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting))."
msgstr ""
"控制器要消费 VR 目标之前，先在该 YAML 里把 `enable_vr: true` "
"打开。同一文件里相关字段：`vr_update_rate`（启用 VR 后生效）和 `vr_follow_frame`（全身跟随坐标系；见 "
"[故障排除](#troubleshooting)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:40
#: dd4c4145008c4948b97c682bfdf251a0
msgid "3. Overview"
msgstr "​3. 概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:42
#: ef94a4d106b6420bb2c33887c59c42bd
msgid ""
"With controllers, VR teleoperation publishes end-effector pose targets "
"from controller tracking. The MPC controller then generates joint "
"trajectories to follow these targets. Optical wrist and bare-hand "
"gestures are [Hand tracking](#vr-hand-tracking)."
msgstr ""
"走手柄时，VR 遥操作按手柄追踪发布末端位姿目标。MPC 控制器再生成关节轨迹去跟这些目标。光学腕和空手手势见 [手部追踪](#vr-hand-"
"tracking)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:44
#: a453b587366a4a94b755599eae1e015d
msgid ""
"On a real arm, use [How to use impedance "
"control](../4-controllers/13-force_control.md) when the arm should give "
"under contact. MIT-mode force control covers Panthera HT and ARX. Vendor "
"joint impedance and payload identification cover Tianji and Rokae."
msgstr "真机上，手臂要在接触时退让，用 [如何使用阻抗控制](../4-controllers/13-force_control.md)。Panthera HT 和方舟无限走 MIT 力控。天机和珞石走厂商关节阻抗，负载辨识也在这条路径上。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:46
#: fe4893f371e0463d8c2a376070c6c5d5
