#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:48
#: 0bc1acd03c9a45e59e0a0763eca2f998
msgid "4.1 Install fa-py-libraries"
msgstr "4.1 安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:50
#: 39bdc5bcbfba44b3aba123bb4d8674c6
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:57
#: 381f5ba15e014fd2aefa33d855e9fedc
msgid ""
"HTTPS is the public clone. SSH (`git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim"
"/fa-py-libraries.git`) is optional if you already have keys."
msgstr ""
"公开克隆用 HTTPS。若本机已有密钥，SSH（`git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/fa-py-"
"libraries.git`）为可选项。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:59
#: 97e8fdd8e55341f9a5573097b4edbdbb
msgid ""
"What `./init.sh all` does: submodules + Python 3.12 env + "
"`ros2_robot_interface` / `ros2-viser` / `vr_pose_publisher` / "
"`xr_hand_retarget`."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` 会做：子模块 + Python 3.12 环境 + `ros2_robot_interface` / "
"`ros2-viser` / `vr_pose_publisher` / `xr_hand_retarget`。"

