#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:109
#: d1675787f817430e85d6be69e0dafccc
msgid ""
"Each session, run `./run.sh` and choose `4) 启动 XRoboToolkit PC Service`, "
"then `3) 手柄遥操 (controller)`. The same steps as commands are `./run.sh vr-"
"xrt-service` and `./run.sh vr-xrt`. `./run.sh vr-xrt controller` is that "
"controller path. Optical wrists and bare-hand gestures are menu item `2`,"
" below."
msgstr ""
"每次使用时运行 `./run.sh`，先选 `4) 启动 XRoboToolkit PC Service`，再选 `3) 手柄遥操 "
"(controller)`。对应命令是 `./run.sh vr-xrt-service` 和 `./run.sh vr-xrt`。`./run.sh "
"vr-xrt controller` 就是这条手柄路径。光学腕和空手手势是下面的菜单第 `2` 项。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:111
#: ea3f288574bd421584d4cec9e73ad8c7
msgid ""
"Requires the **edition-matching** XRoboToolkit App on the headset "
"(Enterprise App ≠ consumer Pico App) plus PC Service. Menu item `5) 关闭 "
"XRoboToolkit PC Service`, or `./run.sh vr-xrt-service stop`, shuts down "
"the PC Service."
msgstr ""
"头显上要装**与版本匹配**的 XRoboToolkit App（企业版 App 和消费版 Pico App 各自对应自己的版本），并开着 PC "
"Service。菜单第 `5) 关闭 XRoboToolkit PC Service` 项，或 `./run.sh vr-xrt-service "
"stop`，会关掉 PC Service。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:113
#: 4a3052afaf4c47c5b3f83cf62c1af5ce
msgid ""
"On Pico, after XRoboToolkit reports Network Status **WORKING**, close the"
" settings panel with the **X** at its top-right. The clip is the headset "
"view in XRoboToolkit 1.1.2: the panel is already up, shared network is "
"checked, and the right-controller ray closes it. With the panel gone, "
"later rays stay on the passthrough view."
msgstr ""
"在 Pico 上，XRoboToolkit 的网络状态显示 **WORKING** 之后，用面板右上角的 **X** "
"关掉设置面板。这段是头显画面（XRoboToolkit "
"1.1.2）：面板已经打开，共享网络已勾选，右手柄射线点在右上角把它关掉。面板收起后，之后的射线留在透视画面上。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:115
#: 9ae4d8ed554a47d982d10d95ce5ff3d4
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/pico-hide-xrobotoolkit-ui.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/pico-hide-xrobotoolkit-ui.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:122
#: bd3cf294c80f4c1aa420bbd53ca6acf2
msgid "6. Hand tracking (手势)"
msgstr "​6. 手部追踪（手势）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:124
#: 31365d13cbb948ec9d9f4ad1de9255e0
msgid ""
"Menu items `6` and `3` follow the VR controllers. Optical wrists and bare"
" hands are menu item `2`."
msgstr "菜单第 `6` 项和第 `3` 项跟的是 VR 手柄。光学腕和空手是菜单第 `2` 项。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:126
#: fe79fe13e88b4d5d9bd2e500c9f7471c
msgid ""
"PC Service is already running (menu item `4`, or `./run.sh vr-xrt-"
"service`). From fa-py-libraries, run `./run.sh` and choose `2) 手部遥操 (光学腕 "
"+ 灵巧手)  — 再选手型`."
msgstr ""
"PC Service 已经在跑（菜单第 `4` 项，或 `./run.sh vr-xrt-service`）。在 fa-py-libraries 里运行 "
"`./run.sh`，选 `2) 手部遥操 (光学腕 + 灵巧手)  — 再选手型`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:128
#: 0fd3cc3495ce4ff0a4b1974f4c1083b5
msgid ""
"The terminal then prints `请选择灵巧手` and lists `xhand1`, `wuji`, `o6`, `l6`,"
" `o7`, and `none`. A choice other than `none` is written to "
"`configs/local.yaml`. `none` keeps the wrists and leaves the dexterous "
"hands off."
msgstr ""
"终端接着打印 `请选择灵巧手`，列出 `xhand1`、`wuji`、`o6`、`l6`、`o7` 和 `none`。除 `none` 以外的选择会写入 "
"`configs/local.yaml`。选 `none` 时保留光学腕，灵巧手保持关闭。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:130
#: 5ca7cbecc4c24d79804503bc5b49dd44
msgid ""
"`./run.sh vr-hand` asks the same question and starts this path. `./run.sh"
" vr-xrt wrist` is that wrist path with the hand already chosen. `FA_HAND`"
" overrides `configs/local.yaml` (`xhand1`, `wuji`, `o6`, `l6`, `o7`, "
"`none`). These are the same choices as commands:"
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh vr-hand` 会问同一个问题，然后走这条路径。`./run.sh vr-xrt wrist` "
"是已经选好手型的光学腕路径。`FA_HAND` 覆盖 "
"`configs/local.yaml`（`xhand1`、`wuji`、`o6`、`l6`、`o7`、`none`）。下面这些命令是同一种选择："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:134
#: 1f3ce047fcbd422bbc47fb7e6f33a68b
msgid ""
"FA_HAND=wuji ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"FA_HAND=none ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt wrist --no-hands"
msgstr ""
"FA_HAND=wuji ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"FA_HAND=none ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt wrist --no-hands"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:142
#: b6fb9af05b964eccb45f83979b4695f0
msgid ""
"One PC Service takes one SDK client. While `vr-xrt` is running, leave "
"`xr_hand_retarget` stopped."
msgstr "一个 PC Service 只接一个 SDK 客户端。`vr-xrt` 在跑时，不要再开 `xr_hand_retarget`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:140
#: 8b7846a128a14ba18f82ac8b7a3d6d56
msgid ""
"Turn the hand on or off in the XRoboToolkit floating settings panel. The "
"RViz card shows the mode. In the clip (Pico Enterprise passthrough, "
"XRoboToolkit 1.1.2), Network Status is already **WORKING**, shared "
"network is on, and Enterprise tracking is checked. Under Tracking, Head "
"stays on; turn **Hand** on and **Controller** off. The physical "
"controllers can stay on the desk. Close the panel with the top-right "
"**X** before teleop, so later rays stay on the passthrough view. That "
"close is the clip above."
msgstr ""
"在 XRoboToolkit 浮动设置面板里开关手部追踪。RViz 卡片显示的是模式。这段录像（Pico 企业版透视，XRoboToolkit "
"1.1.2）里，网络状态已经是 **WORKING**，共享网络已开，企业追踪已勾选。Tracking 下面，Head 保持开；把 **Hand** "
"打开，**Controller** 关掉。实体手柄可以留在桌上。遥操作前用右上角 **X** "
"关掉面板，之后的射线才留在透视画面上。关掉面板的操作见上面那段录像。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 6f0ff6da00744bc094b8945a9840b1c9
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/vr-gesture-hand-tracking.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/vr-gesture-hand-tracking.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:152
#: 55906566431c46a5890c22770cabc82a
msgid ""
"After the panel closes, the operator uses bare hands. The wheeled dual-"
"arm in the “VR 遥操作” view follows the gestures."
msgstr "面板关掉之后，操作者用空手。“VR 遥操作”画面里的轮式双臂跟着这些手势走。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:150
#: 9b14cac8d13749729fff86de21ea1348
msgid ""
"The foot pedal publishes events on `teleop/controller_state` (FSM, UPDATE"
" / STORAGE, mirror). With no pedal, run `./run.sh vr-ocs2` to publish "
"`/fsm_command` `3` (OCS2)."
msgstr ""
"脚踏板把事件发在 `teleop/controller_state`（FSM、UPDATE / STORAGE、镜像）。没有脚踏板时，运行 "
"`./run.sh vr-ocs2`，发布 `/fsm_command` `3`（OCS2）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:156
#: f3baa83a3dbe4369831d16dd8ca94cec
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Wrist and headset poses are on `/teleop/head_pose`, "
"`/teleop/left_ee_pose`, and `/teleop/right_ee_pose` ({ref}`teleop-pose-"
"stream`). The dexterous-hand joint command is `q_des` ([xr_hand_retarget "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md))."
msgstr ""
"腕部和头显位姿在 `/teleop/head_pose`、`/teleop/left_ee_pose` 和 "
"`/teleop/right_ee_pose`（{ref}`遥操位姿流 <teleop-pose-stream>`）。灵巧手关节命令是 "
"`q_des`（[xr_hand_retarget "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:154
#: 4847400a76f24ab9b928e44fa420ff4f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The RViz card shows the mode the headset is in. [Current mode](#teleop-"
"mode-status). Field names are on {ref}`Teleop topics and data <teleop-"
"topics-and-data>`."
msgstr ""
"RViz 卡片显示头显当前的模式。[当前模式](#teleop-mode-status)。字段名见 {ref}`遥操相关话题与数据说明 "
"<teleop-topics-and-data>`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:156
#: ae58166469314389ae9748387c41b22d
msgid "7. Arm Following"
msgstr "​7. 机械臂跟随"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:166
#: cc215c1e90de4b4a8c63705af966f859
msgid "Configure which arm follows which controller:"
msgstr "配置哪条机械臂跟随哪个手柄："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:168
#: f3203517877f445b806c280fc920ca2b
msgid ""
"# In configuration or launch\n"
"teleop_config:\n"
"  left_arm: \"left_controller\"\n"
"  right_arm: \"right_controller\"\n"
"  # or for single arm:\n"
"  right_arm: \"any_controller\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# In configuration or launch\n"
"teleop_config:\n"
"  left_arm: \"left_controller\"\n"
"  right_arm: \"right_controller\"\n"
"  # or for single arm:\n"
"  right_arm: \"any_controller\"\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:170
#: ec46a1002e244947b9f14b99d19ebb93
msgid "8. Controller buttons (分体 vs 全身)"
msgstr "​8. 手柄按键（分体 vs 全身）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:180
#: c4055679efa64e6882dae0f6aaffd700
msgid ""
"Bindings depend on whether the robot is running **分体** "
"(`split_body.launch.py`) or **全身** (`full_body.launch.py`). Shared on "
"both:"
msgstr ""
"按键取决于当前跑的是 **分体**（`split_body.launch.py`）还是 "
"**全身**（`full_body.launch.py`）。两种模式共用："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 22f44bcdee83484f9c670aa7bcccd8d6 3958bd8c5535412090fb7552404e35df
#: 3972af49ca0c40bb9053a522e98455ba
msgid "Control"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 4baee12768934f5aa42959eededf9fe5 81944453d64d4d74ad38cbf3e09fe7f9
msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 29ac84bc178b43abb1f13aab09c40dab
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "扳机"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 56fda6a614ca4c648a62707501cb96a9
msgid ""
"Gripper — pull for proportional open/close; in open/close mode, tap "
"toggles"
msgstr "夹爪 — 按拉动比例开合；开合模式下点按切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 2facb229fc664b399b99ca77cdecaea7
msgid "Right **A** / left **X**"
msgstr "右 **A** / 左 **X**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 7d9473e9889644ddb27231fa597be225
msgid ""
"FSM forward (`HOLD`→`OCS2`, `HOME`→`HOLD`) / back (`OCS2`→`HOLD`, "
"`HOLD`→`HOME`)"
msgstr "FSM 前进（`HOLD`→`OCS2`，`HOME`→`HOLD`）/ 后退（`OCS2`→`HOLD`，`HOLD`→`HOME`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 3ed1da6bc1e74493a0e2f8df931e3a4d
msgid "Left stick click"
msgstr "左摇杆点击"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 7124c32462494c56aabb3ce3582eb258
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "镜像"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: b06c70f8115b4df3b16e53b404480dc7
msgid "Right stick click"
msgstr "右摇杆点击"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: b27534dca4064b73a52c30c6cf11db48
msgid "`STORAGE` ↔ `UPDATE` (**OCS2 only**)"
msgstr "`STORAGE` ↔ `UPDATE`（**仅 OCS2**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 5bd562c434db4cdaa3de382d035f79e3
msgid "Grip (short press)"
msgstr "握把（短按）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: dd2337b79f30444a9ba526957589798e
msgid "Toggle stick plane (`XY` ↔ `Z+Yaw`)"
msgstr "切换摇杆平面（`XY` ↔ `Z+Yaw`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 76b390960129469190392f23fb1e5bfb
msgid "Left **Y** / right **B**"
msgstr "左 **Y** / 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 15b5f40ca6154ad0b5de4103a573e5dc
msgid ""
"Per-arm: **分体** = VR pause/resume (停发指令). **全身** default = that arm’s WBC"
" ENABLE/DISABLE (停单臂); after event 16, same pause/resume. See [Stop one "
"arm vs stop sending VR commands](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-"
"commands)."
msgstr ""
"按臂：**分体** = VR 暂停/恢复（停发指令）。**全身** 默认 = 该臂 WBC `ENABLE`/`DISABLE`（停单臂）；事件 "
"16 之后变为同样的暂停/恢复。见 [停单臂 vs 停发指令](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-"
"commands)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:191
#: 7bacdfcf4195476e93e1dad335cbcd4d
msgid "**全身** adds grip + stick (ignored in 分体; FSM must already be **OCS2**):"
msgstr "**全身** 额外提供握把 + 摇杆（分体下忽略；FSM 须已在 **OCS2**）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 70874daf5c7d4667b3ad4a893debb6eb
msgid "Left grip + left stick"
msgstr "左握把 + 左摇杆"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 8016bcfd0c404a3fa621fefe52c492e5
msgid "Body: up = upright, down = lock waist, left = follow, right = custom lock"
msgstr "身体：上 = 竖直，下 = 锁定腰部，左 = 跟随，右 = 自定义锁定"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 152cf214727647cbb244842da5b27dcd
msgid "Right grip + right stick"
msgstr "右握把 + 右摇杆"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 07a87350fa714748ad8e3368b9a4ea8a
msgid ""
"WBC: up = dual-arm couple on/off, down = chassis unlock/lock, left = "
"reserved, right = reference-joint track"
msgstr "WBC：上 = 双臂耦合开/关，下 = 底盘解锁/锁定，左 = 预留，右 = 参考关节追踪"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 2db63270175748e49156c0bf2705ea65
msgid "Both grips + left **Y** + right **B**"
msgstr "双手握把 + 左 **Y** + 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 397c222fd5f64ad5bbc9290b10690be5
msgid "Event 16: toggle the Y/B latch between WBC arm disable and VR pause/resume"
msgstr "事件 16：把 **Y**/**B** 锁存在 WBC 停单臂与 VR 停发指令之间切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:199
#: 1eeae4ed7f1f41aba947d3222c4f762e
msgid ""
"Grip + same-hand trigger switches that trigger’s gripper between percent "
"and open/close. Pressing left **Y** and right **B** together (no grips) "
"is scale-align (turns mirror off and returns to `STORAGE`). Both sticks "
"together toggle chassis teleop ↔ end-effector control."
msgstr ""
"握把 + 同侧扳机切换该扳机所映射夹爪的百分比 / 开合模式。同时按下左 **Y** 和右 **B**（不按握把）为尺度对齐（关闭镜像并退回 "
"`STORAGE`）。左右摇杆同时按下切换底盘遥控 ↔ 末端控制。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:194
#: 5769b9ffc7d241c6a9d25a4f12946fff
msgid "8.1 Stop one arm vs stop sending VR commands"
msgstr "8.1 停单臂 vs 停发指令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: f2289b85e3864b80b3a670f17abadb01
msgid "停单臂 vs 停发指令"
msgstr "停单臂 vs 停发指令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:199
#: e70ee7802611494296e4878692ca1649
msgid ""
"On **全身**, default left **Y** / right **B** requests that arm’s WBC "
"ENABLE/DISABLE (**停单臂**). Teleop pause (**停发指令**) is the other meaning of"
" those buttons. Event 16 flips which meaning **Y** / **B** uses."
msgstr ""
"在**全身**下，默认左 **Y** / 右 **B** 向 WBC 请求该臂 "
"`ENABLE`/`DISABLE`（**停单臂**）。这两个键的另一种含义是遥操暂停（**停发指令**）。事件 16 切换 **Y** / **B** "
"当前用哪一种。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:210
#: f390ac042d7044f98724f53ddc141af8
msgid ""
"Y/B disable and event 16 apply when **全身** is active "
"(`ocs2_wbc_controller`), VR is enabled, and FSM is **OCS2**. "
"Implementation: [VRInputHandler README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_target_manager/VR_INPUT_HANDLER_README.md)"
" (「单臂启用 / 禁用与 Y/B 语义锁存」)."
msgstr ""
"**Y**/**B** 停单臂与事件 16 仅在**全身**已激活（`ocs2_wbc_controller`）、已启用 VR、且 FSM 为 "
"**OCS2** 时生效。实现见 [VRInputHandler README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_target_manager/VR_INPUT_HANDLER_README.md)（「单臂启用"
" / 禁用与 **Y**/**B** 语义锁存」）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: b5ffd80445b0465ca5fe374fda30184b
msgid "What you want"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 5ed7c34096aa4e1baac870b360765fc6
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: c6f61f36328845a9821d6fbd518eed49
msgid "**Stop one arm** (停单臂)"
msgstr "**停单臂**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: e846d11059f1464b8254126c887a7675
msgid "Default left **Y** / right **B**"
msgstr "默认左 **Y** / 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:196
#: 77bb53b1f8ea46cf98f8ff079bada822
msgid ""
"Request that arm’s WBC ENABLE/DISABLE. After WBC confirms `ARM_DISABLED`,"
" VR stops publishing pose to that arm and stops accumulating that arm’s "
"stick offset. The other arm stays controllable. Re-enable rebases from "
"the current robot pose and the current headset / controller pose, then "
"clears that arm’s stick offset. Works in `UPDATE` and in `STORAGE`."
msgstr ""
"向 WBC 请求该臂 `ENABLE`/`DISABLE`。WBC 确认 `ARM_DISABLED` 后，VR "
"停止向该臂发布位姿，也不再累积该臂摇杆偏移。另一臂仍可控制。重新启用时从当前机器人位姿和当前头显/手柄位姿重新对齐基准，并清零该臂摇杆偏移。`UPDATE` "
"和 `STORAGE` 下都可以用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 3518424d7f52443cba31476ee5a0e0a5
msgid "**Stop sending VR commands** (停发指令)"
msgstr "**停发指令**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 28b29d70b79b40ecb724cd6abcd0d396
msgid "After event 16, same left **Y** / right **B**"
msgstr "事件 16 之后，仍是左 **Y** / 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 000800b169854dc4b62ee02a758a0dfa
msgid "Freeze / resume VR input for that arm (pause). Needs `UPDATE`."
msgstr "冻结 / 恢复该臂的 VR 输入。需要 `UPDATE`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 02c55af2e660452c80bd855f335e207b
msgid "Switch Y/B meaning"
msgstr "切换 **Y**/**B** 含义"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 8074d1f3dbd647f18c33d4bac4d457b5
msgid "Event 16: both grips + left **Y** + right **B**"
msgstr "事件 16：双手握把 + 左 **Y** + 右 **B**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 971ed9707ca3489282a2d90c1db9e702
msgid "Latch toggles between “WBC arm disable” and “VR pause/resume”."
msgstr "锁存在「WBC 停单臂」与「VR 停发指令」之间切换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:218
#: 7983b0e825534982be0d6c534a626a40
msgid "**分体** ignores event 16. Left **Y** / right **B** stay VR pause/resume."
msgstr "**分体**忽略事件 16。左 **Y** / 右 **B** 始终是 VR 停发指令（暂停/恢复）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:220
#: bed6be55cd794a5fa62c6ce1967f554f
msgid ""
"Mirror swaps which physical button maps to which arm. WBC "
"enabled/disabled state and rebase stay on the real arm."
msgstr "镜像只交换物理按键到机械臂的映射。WBC 启用/禁用状态与重新对齐始终按实际机械臂保存。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:214
#: 2c8dab987f674163bcdbf8b4f39bd95c
msgid ""
"When event 16 switches to pause and that arm is already `ARM_DISABLED`, "
"the handler requests ENABLE, rebases, then freezes as paused. When it "
"switches back to disable and that arm is already VR-paused, it requests "
"DISABLE, then clears pause after WBC confirms. Under pause semantics, the"
" right-stick click into `UPDATE` leaves the pause set."
msgstr "事件 16 切到停发指令且该臂已是 `ARM_DISABLED` 时，处理程序会请求 ENABLE，重新对齐，再冻结为暂停。切回停单臂且该臂已处于 VR 暂停时，会请求 DISABLE，WBC 确认后再清除暂停。处于停发指令语义时，右摇杆点进 `UPDATE` 会保留这次暂停。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:224
#: 1cfc741c0c1841f195116d02970e4fa3
msgid "Constraints on **全身**:"
msgstr "**全身**约束："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:226
#: be3f68b88a5148eb8d432742bcf46a63
msgid "While the arms are coupled, Y/B cannot toggle a single arm."
msgstr "双臂已耦合时，**Y**/**B** 不能单独切换任一臂。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:227
#: 8eada280e91e4020908eb62add12a47b
msgid "You cannot enable couple while any arm is disabled."
msgstr "任一臂处于禁用时，不能开启双臂耦合。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:228
#: 03facd9c425e465a9db4e03b190f851e
msgid ""
"While coupled, event 16 cannot switch the latch from pause back to "
"disable (the latch stays)."
msgstr "耦合期间，事件 16 不能把锁存从停发指令切回停单臂（锁存不变）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:229
#: c3c372b290dd48f1af95aa574ce6af08
msgid ""
"While a WBC switch or an event-16 conversion is still pending, event 16 "
"and Y/B are ignored."
msgstr "WBC 开关或事件 16 转换仍在等待确认时，事件 16 与 **Y**/**B** 均被忽略。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:230
#: ba9e32f0247b431fbf400980958ba0a0
msgid ""
"If the topology leaves 全身, the latch returns to the default disable "
"meaning."
msgstr "控制拓扑离开全身后，锁存回到默认的停单臂含义。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:224
#: 6fe9f42bfce34504b289b34f3d37e7fb
msgid ""
"`yb_pause_semantics` on `teleop/mode_state` is the current meaning of "
"**Y** / **B**. Per-arm pause is `left_arm_paused` / `right_arm_paused`. "
"WBC enable is `left_arm_state` / `right_arm_state` on `WbcCurrentState`. "
"The RViz card shows the pause. [Current mode](#teleop-mode-status)."
msgstr ""
"`teleop/mode_state` 上的 `yb_pause_semantics` 是 **Y** / **B** 当前的含义。单臂暂停是 "
"`left_arm_paused` / `right_arm_paused`。WBC 使能是 `WbcCurrentState` 上的 "
"`left_arm_state` / `right_arm_state`。RViz "
"卡片上能看到暂停。[当前模式](#teleop-mode-status)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:227
#: 8d4312b2b25241098c8ffa738fda61d0
msgid "9. Current mode"
msgstr "​9. 当前模式"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:229
#: 0fb46b31faab4acfab811188aa8708a0
msgid ""
"The RViz card at the top left of the 3D view shows what the headset "
"session is doing. `TELEOP ON` means the arms follow (UPDATE). `TELEOP "
"OFF` means STORAGE: the latest VR pose stays cached, and arm targets plus"
" the VR gripper wait for the next UPDATE. `L`/`R` `RUN` means that arm is"
" following. `PAUSE` is `left_arm_paused` or `right_arm_paused`. Mirror "
"and the gripper mode are on the same card."
msgstr ""
"三维视图左上角的 RViz 卡片显示头显这一路正在做什么。`TELEOP ON` 表示手臂在跟随（UPDATE）。`TELEOP OFF` 表示 "
"STORAGE：最新的 VR 位姿留在缓存里，手臂目标和 VR 夹爪等到下一次 UPDATE。`L`/`R` 为 `RUN` "
"表示该臂在跟随。`PAUSE` 是 `left_arm_paused` 或 `right_arm_paused`。镜像和夹爪模式也在这张卡片上。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:231
#: ad82a3e9335a4dd9b577dfd025cf02c9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The card reads `teleop/mode_state` (`TeleopModeState`). With no robot "
"namespace the topic is `/teleop/mode_state`. In namespace `/robot_a` it "
"is `/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`. Field names, types, and QoS are on "
"{ref}`Teleop topics and data <teleop-topics-and-data>`."
msgstr ""
"这张卡片读的是 `teleop/mode_state`（`TeleopModeState`）。没有机器人命名空间时，话题是 "
"`/teleop/mode_state`。命名空间为 `/robot_a` 时，话题是 "
"`/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`。字段名、类型和 QoS 见 {ref}`遥操相关话题与数据说明 "
"<teleop-topics-and-data>`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:233
#: aac165feef4541e5a6648a3493016fa0
msgid ""
"Right-stick click toggles UPDATE and STORAGE while FSM is **OCS2**. In "
"UPDATE the trigger writes the gripper."
msgstr "FSM 为 **OCS2** 时，按一下右手柄摇杆，在 UPDATE 和 STORAGE 之间切换。UPDATE 下，扳机写入夹爪。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:235
#: 10c1206f30cc4cf2b0802e3f83d1bcca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On 全身, `yb_pause_semantics` is the current meaning of left **Y** / right "
"**B**. `false` is WBC single-arm disable (停单臂). `true` is teleop pause "
"(停发指令). The buttons are in [Stop one arm vs stop sending VR commands"
"](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands). WBC enable is on {ref}`wbc-"
"current-state`."
msgstr ""
"全身下，`yb_pause_semantics` 是左 **Y** / 右 **B** 当前的含义。`false` 是 WBC "
"单臂禁用（停单臂）。`true` 是遥操暂停（停发指令）。按键说明见 "
"[停单臂与停发指令](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)。WBC 使能见 "
"{ref}`wbc-current-state`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:237
#: fb242ba75f84494cbb3da14b16ce418e
msgid "9.1 RViz teleop HUD"
msgstr "9.1 RViz 遥操状态叠加层"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:239
#: 76718ec7ec1f44829570d1f1d5e252ac
msgid ""
"Add `arms_rviz_control_plugin/TeleopModeDisplay` from Displays → Add. "
"`Scale` runs from 0.5 to 2.0. Put RViz in the same namespace as "
"`arms_target_manager`. The card appears when `teleop/mode_state` arrives "
"with `enabled` true, in any FSM state."
msgstr ""
"在 Displays → Add 里添加 `arms_rviz_control_plugin/TeleopModeDisplay`。`Scale` "
"范围是 0.5 到 2.0。RViz 与 `arms_target_manager` 放在同一命名空间。任意 FSM "
"状态下，`teleop/mode_state` 到达且 `enabled` 为 true 时，卡片就会出现。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:241
#: 24dc1158eaa04d878f05188fa6a63bca
msgid ""
"The card shows `TELEOP` `ON`/`OFF`, `MIRROR`, and `L`/`R` as `RUN` or "
"`PAUSE`, plus the stick plane, chassis, and gripper mode. A click "
"publishes the same `teleop/controller_state` events as the headset: `4` "
"toggles UPDATE, `7` toggles mirror, and `L`/`R` match left **Y** / right "
"**B**. On 全身, when `yb_pause_semantics` is false, `L`/`R` send event `16`"
" first, wait until that flag becomes true, then send `3` or `6`."
msgstr ""
"卡片显示 `TELEOP` 的 `ON`/`OFF`、`MIRROR`，以及 `L`/`R` 的 `RUN` 或 "
"`PAUSE`，还有摇杆平面、底盘和夹爪模式。点击会向 `teleop/controller_state` 发与头显相同的事件：`4` 切换 "
"UPDATE，`7` 切换镜像，`L`/`R` 与左 **Y** / 右 **B** 相同。全身下，`yb_pause_semantics` 为 "
"false 时，`L`/`R` 先发事件 `16`，等到该标志变为 true，再发 `3` 或 `6`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:243
#: d122a07249d64ce9ad44ecac1d99e1d3
msgid ""
"The clip shows this card. `TELEOP ON` is green. `TELEOP OFF` is STORAGE. "
"`PAUSE` is magenta. `RUN` is green. `STICK XY` is the arm stick plane. "
"`WAIST XY` and `WAIST ZYAW` replace those labels while the body mode is "
"跟随. `GRIP %` is percent mode. `GRIP SW` is open/close."
msgstr ""
"这段录像就是这张卡片。`TELEOP ON` 是绿色。`TELEOP OFF` 是 STORAGE。`PAUSE` 是品红。`RUN` "
"是绿色。`STICK XY` 是手臂摇杆平面。身体模式为跟随时，这些标签换成 `WAIST XY` 和 `WAIST ZYAW`。`GRIP %` "
"是比例模式。`GRIP SW` 是开合模式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:310
#: f846f057ba1a41629cea461a93c994df
msgid ""
"`MIRROR` stays `OFF` for the whole clip. The card moves from TELEOP off "
"with both arms running, to TELEOP on, through a one-arm pause, then to "
"the waist labels. `GRIP` flips from `%` to `SW` and back; while it shows "
"`SW`, the gripper panel’s buttons read Close."
msgstr ""
"整段里 `MIRROR` 一直是 `OFF`。卡片从 TELEOP 关闭、双臂 RUN，到 TELEOP 打开，经过单臂 "
"PAUSE，再切到腰部标签。`GRIP` 在 `%` 和 `SW` 之间来回切换；显示 `SW` 时，夹爪面板上的按钮为 `Close`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:312
#: 78a7783f39d04cf2b1b7500ff95c9234
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/vr-teleop-rviz-hud.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/vr-teleop-rviz-hud.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:318
#: 629c0dc4868f4f8ca0a1aa83ced77d9d
msgid ""
"Sources: [arms_rviz_control_plugin README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_rviz_control_plugin/README.md)"
" (遥操状态 HUD), [VRInputHandler README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_target_manager/VR_INPUT_HANDLER_README.md),"
" and [arms_target_manager README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_target_manager/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"来源：[arms_rviz_control_plugin README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_rviz_control_plugin/README.md)（遥操状态"
" HUD）、[VRInputHandler README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_target_manager/VR_INPUT_HANDLER_README.md)，以及"
" [arms_target_manager README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_target_manager/README.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:255
#: a5dfe77c1ce2498a8ed0050707850a74
msgid "10. Safety"
msgstr "​10. 安全"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:322
#: cc7ad4ab473b4c93b8c8d71d254add8d
msgid "Motion Limits"
msgstr "运动限制"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:325
#: bdda239d2ce14ab1a6d7af6070cd4639
msgid "VR teleoperation can command rapid motions. When using real hardware:"
msgstr "VR 遥操作可能发出快速运动指令。使用真实硬件时："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:326
#: 52421c9681294c73bdbc49b91d76020d
msgid "Start with low speed limits"
msgstr "从较低速度限制开始"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:327
#: 736492cab9ef4752bfea54ea61f171d8
msgid "Keep hand on emergency stop"
msgstr "手放在急停开关上"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:328
#: 65eb0476897148c5a798ccee11d372f2
msgid "Clear the robot workspace"
msgstr "清空机器人工作空间"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:329
#: 36cf5678baa24b4e9084f5ec92ad0f3d
msgid "Use workspace limits in software"
msgstr "在软件中使用工作空间限位"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:267
#: 6a1e1ee8a35b443895fb27696e463e02
msgid "11. Network Setup"
msgstr "​11. 网络设置"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:334
#: bcf3f454871b4dc4be5adfbc1513e47f
msgid ""
"The headset and the ROS 2 PC must be on a reachable network (same Domain "
"ID; Zenoh or DDS as needed)."
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机必须处于可达网络（相同 Domain ID；按需使用 Zenoh 或 DDS）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:271
#: 81c255cb8a8346258f6ab7f2ad4e0ee8
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) — tether the "
"headset to the PC over USB so they share a network. Use the headset’s own"
" USB-network UI."
msgstr "**Pico 企业版：** USB 网络共享 — 用 USB 把头显接到电脑，让两边在同一网络里。用头显自带的 USB 网络界面。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:337
#: fd1fa5e5b0b34aeab9012a620de10c93
msgid ""
"**Pico consumer / Meta Quest:** use the usual Wi-Fi (or other IP) path. "
"Do not assume USB 网络共享."
msgstr "**Pico 消费版 / Meta Quest：** 使用常规 Wi-Fi（或其他 IP）路径。不要假定有 USB 网络共享。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:339
#: 2e9e4dfd33024159b3f1d34f451ee06d
msgid "Then:"
msgstr "然后："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:341
#: a6648cba188d4966a18d4718e85a62c1
msgid "Confirm both devices can reach each other"
msgstr "确认两台设备能够互相访问"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:342
#: 8c12f0ecdf6244e9a4db81b646247245
msgid "Configure ROS 2 domain or Zenoh bridge if they are not on one LAN"
msgstr "若不在同一局域网，配置 ROS 2 Domain 或 Zenoh 桥接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:343
#: 97e4238a727e4f5bb7ba1e81238fe1ab
msgid "Set firewall rules for ROS 2 ports"
msgstr "为 ROS 2 端口设置防火墙规则"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:280
#: 297dbc875590430e9988a8b453601707
msgid "12. Verification"
msgstr "​12. 验证"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:347
#: 01b64e3efede43e5b29a6e88952e1d00
msgid "VR bridge logs show tracking data"
msgstr "VR 桥接日志显示追踪数据"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:348
#: 33f6055cc6514b978574fe1e5e888d29
msgid ""
"`ros2 topic echo /teleop/right_ee_pose` shows updates (use "
"`/<namespace>/teleop/right_ee_pose` when the robot has a namespace)"
msgstr ""
"`ros2 topic echo /teleop/right_ee_pose` 有更新（机器人有命名空间时用 "
"`/<namespace>/teleop/right_ee_pose`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:349
#: 853c6186ac5e4e2a99b26d59e784c36f
msgid ""
"`ros2 topic echo /teleop/mode_state` shows `update_mode: true` while the "
"arms follow (`/<namespace>/teleop/mode_state` in a robot namespace). "
"Subscribe with QoS `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`."
msgstr ""
"手臂跟随时，`ros2 topic echo /teleop/mode_state` 上 `update_mode: "
"true`（有机器人命名空间时用 `/<namespace>/teleop/mode_state`）。订阅 QoS 用 `Reliable` + "
"`TransientLocal`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:285
#: b53a63c2cd1f482089bc122b760416f0
msgid ""
"The robot follows the VR controllers in UPDATE. In STORAGE the arms and "
"the VR gripper stay put."
msgstr "UPDATE 下机器人跟随 VR 手柄。STORAGE 下手臂和 VR 夹爪保持不动。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:288
#: 95ea23fa57a54abe9d0d7b1bcd05584b
msgid "13. Troubleshooting"
msgstr "​13. 故障排除"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:290
#: 9d5e1b9560b9419eb141c777969f71e3
msgid "13.1 No tracking data"
msgstr "13.1 没有追踪数据"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:356
#: 94b2611934ec4520be20749f95c6766e
msgid "Check VR device is properly tracked"
msgstr "确认 VR 设备追踪正常"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:357
#: e9cd2b0ca46f4ece95e0f76fb6e28caf
