msgid "Check network (Wi-Fi, or USB 网络共享 on Pico Enterprise)"
msgstr "检查网络（Wi-Fi，或 Pico 企业版上的 USB 网络共享）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:359
#: bcf71f48cb864bf4a5c3447198a7f36f
msgid "Confirm the headset App matches the Pico edition (Enterprise vs consumer)"
msgstr "确认头显 App 与 Pico 版本匹配（企业版 vs 消费版）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:297
#: 7930e6848b684bc8b3be166f71ebff4b
msgid "13.2 High latency"
msgstr "13.2 延迟较高"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:363
#: fc13201b60354671b04be498f2088cdf
msgid "Prefer **Pico Enterprise** (USB 网络共享 when possible)"
msgstr "优先使用 **Pico 企业版**（尽可能用 USB 网络共享）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:299
#: 293a5598d3d447c4a271bc3263d425e2
msgid ""
"Use **XRoboToolkit** (menu item `3`, or `./run.sh vr-xrt`). WebXR is menu"
" item `6`"
msgstr "用 **XRoboToolkit**（菜单第 `3` 项，或 `./run.sh vr-xrt`）。WebXR 是菜单第 `6` 项"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:365
#: c7e26cd020724da895739c589fc53403
msgid "Use wired / USB-tethered networking when the headset edition supports it"
msgstr "在头显版本支持时，使用有线 / USB 共享网络"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:366
#: 9f5d12c565e5491990725b54f728f1f0
msgid "Reduce update rate in configuration"
msgstr "在配置中降低更新频率"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:367
#: f835fa1e4946409cb4c43e646e6e7c05
msgid "Check for network congestion"
msgstr "检查是否存在网络拥塞"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:305
#: c4505fe91ee049ddb958dfcb5d0cbb6b
msgid "13.3 Robot doesn't follow"
msgstr "13.3 机器人不跟随"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:371
#: 01a59ea51f23454f9ce53a1c6c592cc8
msgid ""
"Confirm `enable_vr: true` in the description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off)"
msgstr "确认描述包 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中 `enable_vr: true`（多数机型默认关闭）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:307
#: 9f0627f8022d4eb987671d94e40c5f7b
msgid ""
"Confirm `update_mode` is true on `teleop/mode_state` (UPDATE / HUD "
"`TELEOP ON`) after entering OCS2. In STORAGE, arm targets and the VR "
"gripper wait for the next UPDATE."
msgstr ""
"进入 OCS2 后，确认 `teleop/mode_state` 上 `update_mode` 为 true（UPDATE / HUD 上为 "
"`TELEOP ON`）。STORAGE 下，手臂目标和 VR 夹爪等到下一次 UPDATE。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:309
#: 544dc5d37e324502becd70bd44d2e865
msgid ""
"On **全身**, that arm’s `WbcCurrentState` is `ARM_ENABLED`, and "
"`left_arm_paused` / `right_arm_paused` is false when you expect the arm "
"to follow — [Stop one arm vs stop sending VR commands](#stop-one-arm-vs-"
"stop-sending-vr-commands)"
msgstr "**全身**下，期望手臂跟随时，该臂的 `WbcCurrentState` 是 `ARM_ENABLED`，并且 `left_arm_paused` / `right_arm_paused` 为 false — [停单臂 vs 停发指令](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:374
#: 599324a3276b42c3aad01e7922c0f90b
msgid "Check target poses are within workspace"
msgstr "确认目标位姿在工作空间内"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:375
#: d0407ee2ddfd405aa3813bfe6d3dfd53
msgid "Ensure no safety limits are triggered"
msgstr "确认没有触发安全限位"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:313
#: 0c73d7eca5214e509a0c55791ff40588
msgid "13.4 `base_footprint` missing (全身 / FULL_BODY)"
msgstr "13.4 `base_footprint` 缺失（全身 / FULL_BODY）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:315
#: d1f3d37e688d48c7a780a52510514d57
msgid ""
"FULL_BODY may warn that `lookupTransform` cannot find `base_footprint`. "
"Default `vr_follow_frame` is `base_footprint`. Set `vr_follow_frame` in "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` to the robot’s real base (for example "
"`base_link`)."
msgstr "FULL_BODY 可能警告 `lookupTransform` 找不到 `base_footprint`。默认 `vr_follow_frame` 是 `base_footprint`。在 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 里把 `vr_follow_frame` 设成机器人实际基座（例如 `base_link`）。"

